# Copy to ~/.devbox/rc/env — KEY=value lines, loaded into the VM environment
# (login shells and `devbox <cmd>`). Read-only inside the VM. Keep it out of git.
#
# `devbox gh-setup` copies gh auth + git identity from the host. To set it up by
# hand instead: put GH_TOKEN here, git identity + helpers in runtime.sh.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=...
# GH_TOKEN=ghp_...
